D8_envelope_seed3: Enveloped correction as an implied-volatility output: c = BS(x, sqrt(w tau) e^N), whose first-order correction fades like the time value near expiry and away from the strike, with a drift split N = <branch(xi, rho), trunk_1> + (tau / tau_max) <branch(kappa, theta, xi, rho), trunk_2> so that kappa and theta drop out as tau -> 0 (the implied-volatility output without the split is reported as a variant); trained from a fresh start through the Adam and L-BFGS stages
